\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {PriVoke}\xspace  's client, server and opt-in V3 training paths. Local inspection returns an action: ALLOW and WARN send the original body; BLOCK cancels the request. Randomized coarse event fields pass through a separate budgeted reporting channel. In routine training the scheduler requests a cycle per V3 tier, the V3 runtime fits a candidate on frozen labelled releases, and param-update's gates admit it only on its exact parent before signing it; clients load only the pinned release or a signed descendant. V1 models serve detection only.}}{4}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{\privoke 's client, server and opt-in V3 training paths. Local inspection returns an action: ALLOW and WARN send the original body; BLOCK cancels the request. Randomized coarse event fields pass through a separate budgeted reporting channel. In routine training the scheduler requests a cycle per V3 tier, the V3 runtime fits a candidate on frozen labelled releases, and param-update's gates admit it only on its exact parent before signing it; clients load only the pinned release or a signed descendant. V1 models serve detection only}{figure.caption.6}{}}
